


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_8fa0d004:



    voice "HIN_0710"
    hina "「哈啊，小文的膝枕真的好舒服啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_f33276eb:



    voice "FUM_0526"
    fumi "「怎么了，突然撒起娇来」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_ed2d86f5:



    voice "HIN_0711"
    hina "「嗯，上次尝到甜头了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_e2800742:


    "阳菜嘿嘿笑道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_eb3e318c:



    voice "FUM_0527"
    fumi "「绪方同学在的时候你还挺正常的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_6ee6426b:



    voice "HIN_0712"
    hina "「因为伦要是在的话，她绝对会吵着说自己也想要。但是不行，小文的膝枕是只属于我的♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_54d8a55d:


    "阳菜这么说着，用脸蹭了蹭文的大腿，手也在文的大腿和臀部摩挲。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_4ed60375:



    voice "HIN_0713"
    hina "「啊，我也想有个这么软绵绵手感又好的身体」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_f9492801:



    voice "FUM_0528"
    fumi "「呵呵，你这样摸来摸去的好痒啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_0a12fcae:



    voice "HIN_0714"
    hina "「我想着摸摸，是不是就能稍微分给我点呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_2f69193a:



    voice "FUM_0529"
    fumi "「分什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_675fc91e:



    voice "HIN_0715"
    hina "「这团柔软的肉肉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_47c52536:



    voice "FUM_0530"
    fumi "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_eb236d14:


    "天真无邪的阳菜并没注意到自己刚刚戳中了文更加脆弱柔软的地方。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d79d32a9:


    "就算没有恶意也同样会伤害到他人。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_63eac931:



    voice "FUM_0531"
    fumi "「我也说了很多次了，阳菜就保持现在的自己就好。现在这样就很可爱！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_4330590f:


    "啊，阳菜换了个姿势。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_a5ea4ad6:



    voice "HIN_0716"
    hina "「是，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_59fb8ddc:



    voice "FUM_0532"
    fumi "「我觉得阳菜你该多了解了解自己到底有多可爱。不然太可惜了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_48ef0067:



    voice "HIN_0717"
    hina "「呜……有吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_50014719:


    "面对文突然的回应，阳菜的声音里变得摇摆不定。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_2a4ca91b:



    voice "HIN_0718"
    hina "「……小文每次都夸太过啦。搞得人家怪不好意思的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_6a0e56e8:


    "阳菜终于忍不住用双手捂住了脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_51c2495c:



    voice "FUM_0533"
    fumi "「哎呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_b74e7cc9:



    voice "FUM_0534"
    fumi "「……但我说的是事实啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_ff87ebc2:


    "文温柔地爱抚着阳菜的头。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_6275928c:



    voice "HIN_0719"
    hina "「呐，说起来。那个最后怎么处理的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_3c2c26ab:



    voice "FUM_0535"
    fumi "「那个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_4dcb8b28:



    voice "HIN_0720"
    hina "「最近我们发现的那个——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_1d3ff8d2:



    voice "FUM_0536"
    fumi "「天使的羽毛吗？我有好好收起来」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_a7521e61:


    "看来她认定了是天使的。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_973647c1:



    voice "FUM_0537"
    fumi "「抱歉，我一个人独占了。阳菜也想要的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_e0eb2fc2:



    voice "HIN_0721"
    hina "「嗯～小文你拿着吧。我就是想想它去哪了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_2d83e55b:



    voice "FUM_0538"
    fumi "「现在我把它夹在日记本里了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_7f01a9f0:



    voice "HIN_0722"
    hina "「这样啊。要是我或伦拿着的话，感觉马上就会搞丢或者不小心扔了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_5c0eb550:



    voice "FUM_0539"
    fumi "「怎么会扔掉呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_57f7a67d:



    voice "HIN_0723"
    hina "「你很爱护它啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d43bdf3d:



    voice "FUM_0540"
    fumi "「这是当然的。因为是天使的羽毛」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_790c0e18:



    voice "HIN_0724"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_bc80bcbc:



    voice "FUM_0541"
    fumi "「……果然我太孩子气了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_960b3809:



    voice "HIN_0725"
    hina "「才没有，非要说的话我还是挺羡慕你的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_37c579e7:



    voice "FUM_0542"
    fumi "「羡慕……我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_95c7b750:



    voice "HIN_0726"
    hina "「小文真的相信有天使存在啊。能一直坚持某种信念，我觉得是件很了不起的事」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_e5965ebc:



    voice "FUM_0543"
    fumi "「……………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d27cbf73:


    "文忽然摆出副难为情的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_248570e6:



    voice "HIN_0727"
    hina "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_8b5f1e44:



    voice "FUM_0544"
    fumi "「——虽然我嘴上说着相信，其实最近有点没自信了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_44291c54:


    "语气里带着点自嘲。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_4be13240:



    voice "HIN_0728"
    hina "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_628326db:


    "阳菜听到如此意外的回答，不禁仰起头看向文……但是胸挡着看不到脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_7b00d3f3:



    voice "FUM_0545"
    fumi "「天使……自己开始思考会不会她其实不存在……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_bac0f3ac:



    voice "HIN_0729"
    hina "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_0cf95973:



    voice "FUM_0546"
    fumi "「毕竟都是我小时候的事了，也可能是为了自圆其说篡改了记忆也说不定」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_431f06c8:



    voice "FUM_0547"
    fumi "「告诉我鞋子在哪的，或许真的只是一个好心的路人，说完后马上就走掉了而已。一切都可能是我的一厢情愿罢了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d5b2aa9d:



    voice "HIN_0730"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_9e46674a:



    voice "FUM_0548"
    fumi "「而且那之后再也没看到过，便想那是不是儿童的幻想呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_114b4db6:


    "文摆出个大人模样说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d6b16118:



    voice "HIN_0731"
    hina "「但是啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_62646ffb:



    voice "HIN_0732"
    hina "「我觉得相信也无妨呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_48197f49:


    "阳菜一脸少女模样地说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_c716c87b:



    voice "FUM_0549"
    fumi "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_d851eff4:



    voice "HIN_0733"
    hina "「小文要是相信自己看到天使了，那我也相信。所以，你没必要放弃」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_1ae2b2db:



    voice "HIN_0734"
    hina "「如果独自一个人很辛苦的话，那就两个人一起去相信」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_43c18f40:



    voice "FUM_0550"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_e8f69ae6:



    voice "HIN_0735"
    hina "「而且，我其实也——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_aa82cf8f:



    voice "FUM_0551"
    fumi "「谢谢……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_a8a8ff56:


    "文打断了阳菜要说的话，感谢道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_e1e2614f:



    voice "HIN_0736"
    hina "「啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_c33fede2:



    voice "FUM_0552"
    fumi "「有阳菜在太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_35135083:


    "文将双手放到阳菜的脸颊上揉啊揉。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_a27a365d:



    voice "HIN_0737"
    hina "「咩喵咩喵，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_cf93f763:



    voice "FUM_0553"
    fumi "「没什么。但是谢谢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_405dc1c9:



    voice "HIN_0738"
    hina "「怎么了？从刚才开始就在说谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_62a5fa9f:



    voice "FUM_0554"
    fumi "「没事，我就是想谢谢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_66dae95e:



    voice "HIN_0739"
    hina "「是吗？那就当作你的感谢，我再稍微摸会儿大腿咯」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_04_0a2ebd83:



    voice "FUM_0555"
    fumi "「呀，所以都说了会痒的啦」"
